abstract: >
  PyRlm is an experimental Python library for exploring Reinforcement Learning
  Models (RLMs) as architectural and conceptual constructs rather than purely
  algorithmic optimizers. The project focuses on agent-based systems, cognitive
  abstractions, controlled execution, and hybrid learning paradigms, serving
  as a research-oriented platform for experimentation and theoretical inquiry.
